This integration is independent of the upstream projects.

Native model construction adapts vLLM's JinaForRanking implementation:
Copyright contributors to the vLLM project; Apache License 2.0.
https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/4ba787ec9959e566d3b587a796dff07673324da5/vllm/model_executor/models/jina.py
Request generator preparation and indexed asynchronous merging adapt the same
project's pooling/base/serving.py and utils/async_utils.py under that license.
Pool-free FP8 prefill reuses vLLM's Triton sequence lookup from
vllm/v1/attention/ops/triton_attention_helpers.py at the same revision.

The request template, truncation, chunking and query-vector fusion are adapted
from Jina AI's jina-reranker-v3.5 modeling.py at the fixed revision below:
https://huggingface.co/jinaai/jina-reranker-v3.5/blob/e8a93f33f0b22108f8c2364f8484ce3422552fbc/modeling.py
